  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えーと、ボールペンの替え芯と飲み物と──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華は？\r\n今さらだけど俺が買うから車で待っててくれても……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009030020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰が買うのはお菓子～\r\nＰたん三峰の今のお気に入りなんて知らないでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_bad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_bad",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700903/2007009030020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009030030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "でもレジは一緒にさせてね、時短時短\r\n後で精算するから──",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700903/2007009030030"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
