  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "思ったよりアグレッシブな遊び方するんだな！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009030080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あっはは！　何言ってんの！\r\n男兄弟がいたらこうなるに決まってるじゃん！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200700903/2007009030080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009030090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──なんならこの花火をＰたんに向けて、\r\n追いかけてあげましょうか～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_bad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_bad",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700903/2007009030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こらこら待て待て待て……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009030100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "やだなぁ、冗談だよ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700903/2007009030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009030110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰、ちゃーんと常識は弁えてるんだから\r\nそんな間違った遊び方するわけないでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700903/2007009030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009030120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "疑われちゃうなんて、心外～",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700903/2007009030120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よく言う……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『結華はそんなことするはずない』とか言ったら\r\n『おふざけにマジレスはどうかと思う～』みたいに返すし",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『よし来い！』って言ったら\r\nちょっと向けてみるぐらいの気持ちはあっただろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009030130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "え～",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700903/2007009030130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009030140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰のことわかりすぎるくらいわかってくれてるＰたん、\r\n怖～い",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700903/2007009030140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "怖いとか言うな、怖いとか",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009030150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ふふふっ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700903/2007009030150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009030160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "怖いから、花火向けるのはやめてあげるー\r\n……で？　Ｐたんはどれやってるの？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700903/2007009030160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "線香花火だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009030170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "えっ、早くない？",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700903/2007009030170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009030180,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "線香花火って最後じゃないの？\r\nまだ他のも残ってるのに",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700903/2007009030180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は今、こいつを長く育ててやりたい気分なんだ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009030190,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あはは、何それ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700903/2007009030190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009030200,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……じゃあ三峰もやろっかなー\r\n５本ぐらいまとめて──",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700903/2007009030200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "情緒……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009030210,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "この流れで情緒求める方が間違ってるでしょ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700903/2007009030210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009030220,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "一緒にやってもいーい？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700903/2007009030220"
  },
  {
    "select": "勝負するか？",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "攻めたやり方\r\nしないならな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "大事に\r\n使ってくれるなら",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009030230,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "どっちが長く育ててあげられるかってやつ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700903/2007009030230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009030240,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "んふふー、乗った！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700903/2007009030240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009030250,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "勝負とあらば、負けませんよぉ\r\n──なんてね！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700903/2007009030250"
  },
